<title>ITALY: Italy's Caffaro sees 1996 pretax profit up.</title>
<headline>Italy's Caffaro sees 1996 pretax profit up.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ending December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(In billion lire unless stated, provisional results)</p>
<p>    Cons turnover			 1,025   (up 11 pct)</p>
<p>    Operating result			 73   vs n/a</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			    81   (up 32 pct)</p>
<p>    Financial charges			20   vs   n/a</p>
<p>    Extraordinary provisions	     29   vs   n/a</p>
<p>Note - Full company name is Caffaro Spa, part of Snia BPD, which in turn is owned by Fiat Spa. It said its operating result was roughly in line with 1995.</p>
</text>
